"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T19:15:21Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T19:15:21Z","body":"> Does this include picking the FPS vs. seconds approach?\r\n\r\nThis affects the `step` value stored in Animation. I think FPS uses the same property.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430055771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430072810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2430072810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2430072810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q1_fq","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T19:24:18Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T19:24:55Z","body":"> > Does this include picking the FPS vs. seconds approach?\n>\n> This affects the `step` value stored in Animation. I think FPS uses the same property.\n\nRight. However, which of the two options is _shown_ after creating a new animation also has a default, namely the 'seconds' option. As someone who makes new animations all the time, and then having to switch to 'fps' before I can set the fps value, setting the default value only partially addresses my UX hiccup.\n\nPerhaps this is a different feature request, idk... it's super closely related.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430072810/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430078213","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2430078213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2430078213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q2A0F","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T19:27:15Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T19:27:29Z","body":"Yes, it's a different thing. I can open a PR for that too if there isn't one already.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430078213/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2481673863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2481673863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2481673863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T61aH","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-17T23:33:45Z","updated_at":"2024-11-17T23:33:45Z","body":"The concern with this is that the snap value is recorded for each Animation, so it conflicts with that. Should we remove the snap value from the Animation resource?\r\n\r\nAlso this may cause some confusion, especially since KeyEditInspector's Spinner's FPS in FPS mode depends on snap value.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2481673863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2481693543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2481693543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2481693543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T66Nn","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-18T00:11:30Z","updated_at":"2024-11-18T00:11:30Z","body":"> Should we remove the snap value from the Animation resource?\r\n\r\nIt's only used by the editor, so IMO it shouldn't be in the resource. Though if we wanted to track snap per animation, implementing it otherwise would be tricky. But it's probably irrelevant with the default; personally I always set it to the same value.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2481693543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2622586956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2622586956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2622586956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cUYBM","user":{"login":"pegasusearl","id":23167087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTY3MDg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23167087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl","html_url":"https://github.com/pegasusearl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegasusearl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-29T19:01:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-29T19:02:19Z","body":"I also dislike this new default step value. Since I animate a lot of element directly in godot.\r\n\r\n> The concern with this is that the snap value is recorded for each Animation, so it conflicts with that. Should we remove the snap value from the Animation resource?\r\n\r\nI like the good old 10 fps approach but I sometimes (very rarely) do increase it if I need more detail.\r\nHow about, `default_step` will simply assign snap value to a newly created animation?\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n - set default to 30 fps.\r\n - make animation A. Then animation A will snap at 30 fps\r\n - Set default to 12\r\n - make animation B. Then animation A will still snap at 30 fps, but animation B will snap at 12 fps.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2622586956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625072508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2625072508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2625072508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cd218","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T17:04:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T17:04:42Z","body":"We can't be storing this in seconds until Godot's SpinBox is changed to not truncate values. Because this creates a setting with a default spinbox, Godot will truncate the value the user types and prevent using 1/30.\r\n\r\nThe default is specifically *not* 0.03333. It is 1/30 which is a different number closer to 0.0333333 (with more decimal places). This difference will accumulate and cause rounding error for multi-minute long animations.\r\n\r\nI'm a little curious what the usecase is for using seconds rather than framerate. What if we make the default in frames per second.\r\n\r\n> Turns out FPS mode is remembered per scene, so a setting for default makes sense.\r\n\r\nIf it's per-scene, I wonder if we could change the default FPS for 2D scenes to be 10 like before, and for 3D to 30.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625072508/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625276287","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2625276287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2625276287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ceol_","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T18:33:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T18:38:30Z","body":"@lyuma Doesn't the fps compatible mode solve your pointed out matter?\r\n\r\n> For FPS compatible mode, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99013. This is an option that internally sets whether it snaps to FPS or not.\r\n> To give a concrete example, in the case of 0.333 snaps:\r\n> If FPSCompatible mode is disabled, the key reaches 0.999 after 3 moves from 0\r\n> If FPSCompatible mode is enabled, the key reaches 1.0 after 3 moves from 0","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625276287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625706298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2625706298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2625706298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cgRk6","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T22:12:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T22:12:33Z","body":"I pushed a custom hint for the property. It allows to override the default float step. 8 decimal places is enough I guess 🤔\r\nNote that default value of 1/30 is not affected either way, because it's not stored anywhere (because it's default).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625706298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631024997","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98414#issuecomment-2631024997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98414","id":2631024997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c0kFl","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organi